  <section id="digital-earth-africa-data-and-products">
<span id="data-specs"></span><h1>Digital Earth Africa Data and Products<a class="headerlink" href="#digital-earth-africa-data-and-products" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h1>
<p>Digital Earth Africa provides Earth observation datasets and decision-ready products covering continental Africa.
These are organised into DE Africa Continental Services and external datasets made available through DE Africa.</p>
<p><strong>Jump to:</strong> <a class="reference internal" href="#de-africa-continental-services">DE Africa Continental Services</a> | <a class="reference internal" href="#external-datasets">External Datasets</a></p>
<section id="de-africa-continental-services">
<h2>DE Africa Continental Services<a class="headerlink" href="#de-africa-continental-services" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h2>
<p>These are datasets and products processed and maintained by Digital Earth Africa for consistent coverage across the African continent.</p>
<section id="agriculture">
<h3>Agriculture<a class="headerlink" href="#agriculture" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
<div class="toctree-wrapper compound">
</div>
<div class="product-list docutils container">
<div class="product-item docutils container">
<img alt="Cropland extent" loading="lazy" src="../_images/crop_thumbnail.png" />
<p><a class="reference internal" href="Cropland_extent_specs.html"><span class="doc">Cropland Extent</span></a></p>
<p>Estimated locations of croplands across Africa.</p>
<p><a class="reference internal" href="Cropland_extent_specs.html"><span class="doc">View product details →</span></a></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="coastal">
<h3>Coastal<a class="headerlink" href="#coastal" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
<div class="toctree-wrapper compound">
</div>
<div class="product-list docutils container">
<div class="product-item docutils container">
