<p><a class="reference internal" href="Coastlines_specs.html"><span class="doc">Digital Earth Africa Coastlines</span></a></p>
<p>Annual shorelines and coastal-change rates across Africa at 30 m resolution from 2000 to the present.</p>
<p><a class="reference internal" href="Coastlines_specs.html"><span class="doc">View product details →</span></a></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="geomedians">
<h3>Geomedians<a class="headerlink" href="#geomedians" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
<div class="toctree-wrapper compound">
</div>
<div class="product-list docutils container">
<div class="product-item docutils container">
<img alt="Geometric Median and Median Absolute Deviation products" loading="lazy" src="../_images/GeoMAD_thumbnail.png" />
