<img alt="World Settlement Footprint" loading="lazy" src="../_images/WSF_thumbnail.png" />
<p><a class="reference internal" href="World_Settlement_Footprint_specs.html"><span class="doc">World Settlement Footprint</span></a></p>
<p>Global settlement maps for 2015 and 2019 at 10 m resolution, with annual settlement-growth information at 30 m resolution.</p>
